PixelBar Studio is an independent community project, not an official EDIFIER
or OpenAI product. Product names are used only to identify interoperability.
No TempoHub binary, source, extracted bytecode, artwork or account credentials
are redistributed. Device communication is independently implemented.

The macOS companion distribution includes Node.js. Node.js and its included
dependencies retain their respective licenses. Complete license text is
provided in Contents/Resources/runtime/NODE-LICENSE.txt.
Source: https://github.com/nodejs/node/blob/v24.21.0/LICENSE

Quota retrieval invokes the user's separately installed Codex app-server;
Codex itself is not bundled. This reads the Codex rate-limit bucket, not all
ChatGPT conversations, subscription message counts, or API billing.

Bundled bitmap font data is converted from official 2026.09.25 BDF releases
of Fusion Pixel Font (TakWolf, copyright 2022) and Ark Pixel Font (TakWolf,
copyright 2021). Font data remains under SIL OFL 1.1, NOT the project's MIT
license. Complete upstream and dependency licenses are retained under
web/fonts/licenses (Contents/Resources/studio/web/fonts/licenses in the app).
Sources: https://github.com/TakWolf/fusion-pixel-font
         https://github.com/TakWolf/ark-pixel-font
See docs/FONTS.md for provenance and reproducible conversion.
